{"4809500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hop 'n' Karty", "steam_appid": 4809500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4907080], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RETRO KART RACER RE-IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic 3D kart racers from the 1990s, Hop 'n' Karty brings something new to the kart racing genre. From track variety to unlockable driven progression, Hop 'n' Karty is sure to bring a smile to racing fans everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=764 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK ALL YOUR FAVOURITE CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the courses and collect tokens to unlock new characters. Choose which characters you want to get first and build your roster of racers, each with a unique kart and unique stats. Experiment with different racers playstyle to find your favourite and then challenge your friends or your previous records and see how much you can improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY TRACK IS A NEW ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two tracks feel the same. Every track is in a new environment and will offer a a new challenge. From a toy plastic racetrack taking you underneath the living room furniture, to a vintage, wooden rollercoaster which barrels through the racers as they go, there is no shortage of fun experiences to be had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/955f980d2668af1b227356a74276e225.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/955f980d2668af1b227356a74276e225.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/955f980d2668af1b227356a74276e225.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETE AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS, YOURSELF, AND ME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play local multiplayer with up to 4 players to go head to head directly with others in grand prix or free play races, or challenge yourself to a solo time trial race to save your best time and then race against it. You can also challenge developer time records and try to beat my best time on every track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/fd509b62aa5856a8842fad0156ed9dce.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/fd509b62aa5856a8842fad0156ed9dce.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/fd509b62aa5856a8842fad0156ed9dce.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUST GOOD OLD FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop 'n' Karty has one aim above any other, to give players a fun time. With colourful tracks, upbeat music and a cast of cute characters, Hop 'n' Karty wants you to jump in and have a great time regardless of your age or your gaming background, and I hope you find Hop 'n' Karty as fun as I do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/ebf2cb3a4e41cdcead8da0213b39d722.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=874 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/ebf2cb3a4e41cdcead8da0213b39d722.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/ebf2cb3a4e41cdcead8da0213b39d722.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RETRO KART RACER RE-IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic 3D kart racers from the 1990s, Hop 'n' Karty brings something new to the kart racing genre. From track variety to unlockable driven progression, Hop 'n' Karty is sure to bring a smile to racing fans everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=764 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/e5f329a23a2d61a99913af537b40056f.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK ALL YOUR FAVOURITE CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the courses and collect tokens to unlock new characters. Choose which characters you want to get first and build your roster of racers, each with a unique kart and unique stats. Experiment with different racers playstyle to find your favourite and then challenge your friends or your previous records and see how much you can improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.poster.avif?t=1787172639\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.webm?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809500/extras/157efca8a2063c67742d7e81a8550665.mp4?t=1787172639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY TRACK IS A NEW ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two tracks feel the same. Every track is in a new environment and will offer a a new challenge. From a toy plastic racetrack taking you underneath the living room furniture, to a vintage, wooden rollercoaster which barrels through the racers as they go, there is no shortage of fun experiences to be had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama